{"about_the_game":"<strong>DAYBREAK</strong> is a co-op horror game about surviving in a world consumed by deadly solar radiation.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/World_In_Ruin.jpg?t=1747212384\" />The collapse of the ozone layer was catastrophic. Temperatures soared. Society fell apart.<br>Governments did what they could \u2014 treatments, curfews, military blockades.<br>But the radiation only worsened, triggering widespread and violent mutations.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/Never_Give_Up.jpg?t=1747212384\" />You play as a group of survivors sheltering in Pelican City\u2019s underground subway system.<br>Venture into the city at night to gather scarce resources.<br>As sunrise nears, radiation builds and the city fills with mutant creatures.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/Who_s_Got_Your_Back.jpg?t=1747212384\" />Communicate using proximity voice chat and walkie-talkies.<br>Craft, carry, and manage supplies as a team.<br>But be careful who you trust\u2014some things don\u2019t stay human for long.<br>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3078760?t=1747212384","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/468cee7154393094f7b4a1134be42ea37eea289b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747212384","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/fdd34c8b77b33d88e25c8ac15dc34392bcd971ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747212384","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/fdd34c8b77b33d88e25c8ac15dc34392bcd971ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747212384","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9}